Name: allowapop
Type: SWITCH
Default-Value: 1
Last-Modified: 2.3.17

Allow use of the POP3 APOP authentication command.

.. Note::

    This option has no effect unless the following are all true:

    * cyrus-imapd was linked with libsasl2
    * libsasl2 was compiled with APOP support
    * plaintext passwords are available in a SASL auxprop backend
    * the system can provide enough entropy to create a challenge in the banner
